    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/08e4285552135c0b856f2c7dc053ad42.avif?t=1748852807\" width=614 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in your hospital room in the middle of the night and you don't know how much time has passed. Find a way out of this nightmare before it\u2019s too late. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/0b5d3748fa032e9c6676cf994730a987.avif?t=1748852807\" width=614 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something must be wrong, <strong>being in the dark hurts</strong>. You have to get out before that thing finds you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/781ce09832fb853c54d59f8ded7b0a07.poster.avif?t=1748852807\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/781ce09832fb853c54d59f8ded7b0a07.webm?t=1748852807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/781ce09832fb853c54d59f8ded7b0a07.mp4?t=1748852807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/5fd5c64bb049938fae5ed9d6f75f4a30.avif?t=1748852807\" width=614 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather tools and information to help you solve puzzles and overcome drawbacks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/f78141f08cff2830c70d6098680c7e75.poster.avif?t=1748852807\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/f78141f08cff2830c70d6098680c7e75.webm?t=1748852807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/f78141f08cff2830c70d6098680c7e75.mp4?t=1748852807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/d33c4f9ab91bdab797d6e481019860dc.avif?t=1748852807\" width=614 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help out and befriend survivors scattered across the hospital in order to advance towards the exit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/d5399b52744a86a54399f8c44592a35b.poster.avif?t=1748852807\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/d5399b52744a86a54399f8c44592a35b.webm?t=1748852807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/d5399b52744a86a54399f8c44592a35b.mp4?t=1748852807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/08e4285552135c0b856f2c7dc053ad42.avif?t=1748852807\" width=614 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in your hospital room in the middle of the night and you don't know how much time has passed. Find a way out of this nightmare before it\u2019s too late. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/0b5d3748fa032e9c6676cf994730a987.avif?t=1748852807\" width=614 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something must be wrong, <strong>being in the dark hurts</strong>. You have to get out before that thing finds you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/781ce09832fb853c54d59f8ded7b0a07.poster.avif?t=1748852807\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/781ce09832fb853c54d59f8ded7b0a07.webm?t=1748852807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/781ce09832fb853c54d59f8ded7b0a07.mp4?t=1748852807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/5fd5c64bb049938fae5ed9d6f75f4a30.avif?t=1748852807\" width=614 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather tools and information to help you solve puzzles and overcome drawbacks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/f78141f08cff2830c70d6098680c7e75.poster.avif?t=1748852807\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/f78141f08cff2830c70d6098680c7e75.webm?t=1748852807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/f78141f08cff2830c70d6098680c7e75.mp4?t=1748852807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/d33c4f9ab91bdab797d6e481019860dc.avif?t=1748852807\" width=614 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help out and befriend survivors scattered across the hospital in order to advance towards the exit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/d5399b52744a86a54399f8c44592a35b.poster.avif?t=1748852807\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/d5399b52744a86a54399f8c44592a35b.webm?t=1748852807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/d5399b52744a86a54399f8c44592a35b.mp4?t=1748852807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
